らえると嬉しいです。\n2人を別々に描くか一緒に描くかはおまかせしますが、できれば2人とも上半身は描いていただければと思います(全身を描くかまではお任せします)。\n細かいお願いばかりで申し訳ありませんが、どうかよろしくお願いします…！", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@Ri__tmm/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3659767, "client_id": 3229666, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aade9439/uploads/origins/fdb689e7-1f97-4309-ab6c-96df6da796a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75f1daeb2a13d061da3a9517a1ab245a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aade9439/uploads/origins/fdb689e7-1f97-4309-ab6c-96df6da796a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=75f1daeb2a13d061da3a9517a1ab245a, https://si.imgix.net/aade9439/uploads/origins/fdb689e7-1f97-4309-ab6c-96df6da796a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=07bc8762c5531b09b343799551e007e6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aade9439/uploads/origins/fdb689e7-1f97-4309-ab6c-96df6da796a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aab3d6714f0fefbdde2ca0ab868d18f4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aade9439/uploads/origins/fdb689e7-1f97-4309-ab6c-96df6da796a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f4692f73a64bc32fbda7fadb3c432cde", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aade9439/uploads/origins/fdb689e7-1f97-4309-ab6c-96df6da796a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f4692f73a64bc32fbda7fadb3c432cde, https://si.imgix.net/aade9439/uploads/origins/fdb689e7-1f97-4309-ab6c-96df6da796a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ecbed419a89af55db5e512e9db336553 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aade9439/uploads/origins/fdb689e7-1f97-4309-ab6c-